# Normalize line endings.  Developed on Windows, graded on a Linux testbed,
# so everything is stored as LF in the repository.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell scripts must stay LF or /bin/sh will choke on the CR.
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf

# Screen captures for the test report.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
